WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.333
You'll only say the real stuff to a camera if you know where it goes.

2
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.406
With Tell Anew, it stays on your phone. No account, no servers of ours.

3
00:00:11.706 --> 00:00:16.345
Your words are written out on the phone itself. It even works in airplane mode.

4
00:00:17.645 --> 00:00:23.195
Turn on Face ID, and the app opens only for you. Even the app switcher shows nothing.

5
00:00:24.495 --> 00:00:28.251
Want a backup? It goes to your own iCloud, and only if you turn it on.

6
00:00:29.551 --> 00:00:33.409
Nothing to set up. It's private from the first recording.
